Package: genefunnel
Title: Gene Set Activity Scoring with GeneFunnel
Version: 0.99.5
Authors@R: 
    person("Emir", "Turkes", email = "emir.turkes@eturkes.com",
        role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
        comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-7447-1476"))
Description: Calculates sample-wise gene-set activity scores from non-negative
    feature-by-sample matrices. A disagreement penalty distinguishes patterns
    with equal totals. The package supports dense and sparse matrices, partial
    coverage, sample-specific missingness, and parallel backends. It does not
    normalize data, map identifiers, or run statistical tests.
